		(at 148.43125 51.271875)
		(descr "Waveshare 8.8inch DSI LCD (driver-board version), 3D model and the stud holes of its driver-board corners (101 x 57 mm, M2.5-H1.5); its Raspberry Pi pattern studs go through the slots of Waveshare_8.8-DSI-TOUCH-A_Studs. Placed to check the fit (both displays are supported); see docs/design-decisions.md. Origin at the glass centre; glass top level with the 8.8-DSI-TOUCH-A. The STEP is Waveshare's and is not in Git (docs/references/lcd/). F.Fab: its standoffs (M2.5; the Raspberry Pi pattern ones go through the slots of Waveshare_8.8-DSI-TOUCH-A_Studs) and the parts on the back of its driver board")
